header of its own in a way that survives its format or its use, so the
attribution is recorded here:

  * oracle/numbas-runtime.js, oracle/locales.js, oracle/marking_scripts.js —
    the compiled Numbas test bundle, copied from tests/numbas-runtime.js,
    tests/locales.js and tests/marking_scripts.js of the Numbas repository at
