    from the Numbas test suite. The JSON format cannot carry a comment.
  * src/marking/scripts/*.jme — the five in-scope marking scripts, copied from
    marking_scripts/ with a three-line license header prepended and nothing
    else changed (test/unit/marking-scripts-embedded.test.ts checks this,
